# Modern Calculator

This repository contains my **Modern Calculator** project developed as part of the **CodSoft Web Development Internship – Level 1 Task 3**.

## 📌 Project Overview
A responsive and interactive calculator built using **HTML, CSS, and JavaScript**. It performs basic arithmetic operations with a clean and modern user interface.

## 🛠️ Technologies Used
- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript

## ✨ Features
- Responsive Design
- Modern UI
- Addition (+)
- Subtraction (-)
- Multiplication (×)
- Division (÷)
- Percentage (%)
- Decimal Support
- AC (All Clear)
- DEL (Delete)
- Error Handling

## 🎯 Learning Outcomes
- Improved HTML, CSS, and JavaScript skills
- Learned DOM Manipulation
- Implemented Calculator Logic
- Enhanced UI Design and Responsive Layout

